    "body": "Macros from the `bitcoin-build-info.h` header [may not be used](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36246#discussion_r4004364105) in `src/clientversion.cpp` depending on the `CLIENT_VERSION_IS_RELEASE` macro value.\r\n\r\nTherefore, enforce IWYU to always keep the header.",
